==Battleground==
*10 [[Croco]]s (1,600%) spawn, delay 8~16 seconds<sup>240f~480f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Croco]]s (400%) spawn, delay 1~16 seconds<sup>30f~480f</sup>.
*5 [[Celeboodle]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 0.67 seconds<sup>20f</sup>.
*20 [[Celeboodle]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 0.67 seconds<sup>20f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Croco]]s (400%) spawn, delay 0.67~3.33 seconds<sup>20f~100f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Master A.]] spawns as the boss.
**20 [[Otta-smack-u]]s spawn, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.
**20 [[Duche]]s spawn, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.

==Strategy==
If you have trouble inflicting damage on Master A., it's a sign that you need [[True Form]] cats.

Master A. has a magnification of 400%. Beware of the peons that support him. Duche and Otta-smack-u are 400% as well so they may plow through your lines easily. Along with that, they are Traitless so only units that specialize in combat against [[:Category:Anti-Traitless Cats|Traitless]] enemies work here, like [[Driller Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Driller Cat]]. [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]] can't hit the Master A. even once, so don't bring him. If you have [[Valkyrie Cat (Special Cat)|Valkyrie Cat]]'s [[True Form]], bring her.

